# On Demand Originals: Implementation Plan

> **Status:** Core build complete, admin UI refinement in progress, preparing for delivery
> **Owner:** Rebeca
> **Last updated:** 2026/09/24

---

## 1. Project Overview

On Demand Originals is a website that lets customers browse, customize, and order original pieces produced on demand.

The public site and core functionality were built with Claude Code. The current focus is refining the backend/admin interface so it is clean, intuitive, and ready to hand off to the client.

### Goals

- Deliver a stable, production-ready site the client can operate without developer support post-launch
- Provide an admin experience that is visually polished and easy to use for non-technical staff
- Document setup, deployment, and day-to-day operations so the admin panel is maintainable

## 2. Scope

### In Scope

| Area | Description |
|------|-------------|
| Public site | Landing, Catalog/listing pages, detail pages, contact/inquiry flow |
| Ordering / requests | Cart, PayPal checkout, Shippo integration, custom request form, quote flow |
| Admin UI | Content management, order/payment management, newsletter templates/delivery, user settings |
| Auth | Owner Admin login and role handling |
| Deployment | Production hosting, domain, DNS, SSL, environment config |
| Documentation | README, admin guide, handoff notes |

