## 4. Architecture

```
[ Public Site ] ──┐
                  ├──> [ API / Server ] ──> [ Database ]
[ Admin UI ] ─────┘            │
                               ├──> [ File Storage ]
                               ├──> [ Payments ]
                               └──> [ Email ]
```

### Key Data Models

- **Product / Original:** title, description, images, pricing, status
- **Order / Request:** customer info, items, specs, status, timestamps
- **Customer:** contact details, order history
- **Admin User:** email, role, last login

### Directory Structure

```
/
├── app/ or src/          # application code
│   ├── (public)/         # public-facing pages
│   ├── admin/            # admin UI
│   └── api/              # API routes
├── components/           # shared UI components
├── lib/                  # utilities, db client, helpers
├── public/               # static assets
├── docs/                 # admin guide, handoff notes
└── IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md
```

